                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "October is Down Syndrome Awareness Month. No matter how many chromosomes, each life is a unique gift with unique values. This year, I introduced legislation so that doctors do not knowingly perform an abortion due to a prenatal diagnosis of Down Syndrome. \nhttps://t.co/IXO15oCY3u https://t.co/fijRE1fypN",
