                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, on World Down Syndrome Day, I am reintroducing the Protecting Individuals with Down Syndrome Act. We must stand up for the most vulnerable and insist that babies who receive a Down syndrome diagnosis are not aborted simply because of their genetic condition with an additional chromosome.",
