                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last Wednesday, I made a visit to Belle Plaine to learn about their new wastewater treatment plant & water tower. In a few months, the new water tower will have water flowing efficiently across Belle Plaine.\n\nProjects like these are vital to the rural towns in Kansas. https://t.co/8Rs2U7zjdk",
