                "quoted_status_profile_username": "WhiteHouse",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Tragically, recent data indicates 67% to 85% of pregnancies in the U.S. with a prenatal diagnosis of Down syndrome end in abortion.\n\nEvery life is precious, and we must defend the most vulnerable in our society. That\u2019s why earlier this year I reintroduced the Protecting Individuals with Down Syndrome Act to ensure no child is denied the chance at life simply because of a diagnosis.\n\nThank you, President Trump, for shining a spotlight on Down Syndrome Awareness Month and affirming the dignity of all individuals with Down syndrome.",
